rt":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631157014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102290#issuecomment-2631157014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102290","id":2631157014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c1EUW","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T14:27:30Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T14:27:30Z","body":"This is likely due to a similar cause as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/67150 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/76166.\n\nFor performance reasons, drivers tend to perform aggressive optimizations when compiling shaders, which leads to artifacts if you are relying on specific behavior without a margin of error to account for it. NVIDIA is most notable for this (even back in the mid-2000s), but all vendors perform different optimizations at one point or another.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631157